     "body": "<p>Broadening the scope of this: there are some manual test classes in the pdp and pep modules, and none in the jaas module.  Real JUnit test coverage on all three of these modules would be good.</p>\n\n<p>cd fcrepo-security<br/>\nfind .|grep src/test|grep java$</p>\n\n<p>./fcrepo-security-pdp/src/test/java/org/fcrepo/server/security/xacml/test/ContextHandler.java<br/>\n./fcrepo-security-pdp/src/test/java/org/fcrepo/server/security/xacml/test/TestDbxmlPolicyDataManager.java<br/>\n./fcrepo-security-pdp/src/test/java/org/fcrepo/server/security/xacml/test/TestFedoraRIAttributeFinder.java<br/>\n./fcrepo-security-pdp/src/test/java/org/fcrepo/server/security/xacml/test/TestFilePDM.java<br/>\n./fcrepo-security-pdp/src/test/java/org/fcrepo/server/security/xacml/test/TestFindPolicies.java<br/>\n./fcrepo-security-pdp/src/test/java/org/fcrepo/server/security/xacml/test/TestPolicyDatabase.java<br/>\n./fcrepo-security-pdp/src/test/java/org/fcrepo/server/security/xacml/test/TestXacmlRequest.java<br/>\n./fcrepo-security-pdp/src/test/java/org/fcrepo/server/security/xacml/util/TestRelationshipResolver.java<br/>\n./fcrepo-security-pep/src/test/java/org/fcrepo/server/security/xacml/test/ContextHandlerTest.java<br/>\n./fcrepo-security-pep/src/test/java/org/fcrepo/server/security/xacml/test/ContextUtilTest.java<br/>\n./fcrepo-security-pep/src/test/java/org/fcrepo/server/security/xacml/test/SnoopFilter.java<br/>\n./fcrepo-security-pep/src/test/java/org/fcrepo/server/security/xacml/test/TestRelationshipResolverImpl.java</p>",
